Actually, I don't like the way the scroll of identify works.  In rogue, you
could type a * and get a list of your inventory, then just pick a letter and
identify it.  In nethack you have to be organized, and even drop items and
try to reorder things in your pack, just to get the most out of the scroll.

It would be much nicer if you could choose which item to use the scroll on
from your entire pack _each_ time the scroll keeps working.  If the scroll
is good for identifying three items, my character ought to be smart enough
to pick out three items to use it on.

You shouldn't need to be a good nethack program-outthinker to be a good
nethack player.

